This product implements the DIDComm Messaging v2.1 specification published by
the Decentralized Identity Foundation (DIF):

    https://identity.foundation/didcomm-messaging/spec/v2.1

The specification's test vectors (Appendix A/B/C) are vendored verbatim into
the test suite as required by the conformance plan.

The live interop harness vendors one file from the Hyperledger Identus mediator
(https://github.com/hyperledger-identus/mediator), unmodified:
tools/interop-live/mediator/identus/initdb.js, from tag v1.2.1 (git blob
5d9bd69def43d27dc835a55ec936fe0c2de91cc7), Copyright 2024 Input Output Global,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It initialises the MongoDB the
harness runs the Identus mediator against and is not part of any package.
